        researcher_agent.function_calling_llm is llm_instance
    ), "researcher agent's function_calling_llm should be the local_llm instance"

    # The reporting analyst agent's function_calling_llm should fallback to string "online_llm"
    # because "online_llm" is not registered in llms, so it falls back to string
